window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>He's the fae prince . . . and the prize for the Bride Games.</p> <p>Too bad I'm not interested.</p> <p>Does that stop him from coming into my life and forcing me to compete? No. Does that stop me from keeping up with my personal agenda? Also no.</p> <p>The competition is fierce and the contestants are even worse. As we enter each round of elimination, I wait for my dismissal. Returning home is my end goal. Not swooning over some fae.</p> <p>Even if he's charming. And he makes me feel alive. Which I won't be for much longer if I stay in the Games. The closer I get to the prince, the more my life is in danger.</p> <p>Or is it my heart that's truly in jeopardy?</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
